Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:18:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1148/1286] HERESY 1167: the takes fold to the right; the
 Creator's player in one row
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026 on the draft: «Одобряю. Takes схлопнул вправо и исчезли
безвозвратно… сворачивается вниз и практически перекрывается серверным логом.
Сворачиваем вправо, текст свёртки поверни на 90%»; «на странице Творца плеер
делаем минималистичным, как в увеличенном режиме скейла. А в других комнатах
оставляем текущие версии плеера».
- Folded, the takes are a 40 px strip at the right edge, «Takes» on its side,
  and the take has the third's whole height (the bar under the take sat under
  the server log, so nothing told where the takes went).
- The player in the Creator is one row from 1660 px, as the scaled-up page
  has it (1150); a long name still wraps to two lines, never cut.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css | 31 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 0b4b243..a18859a 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3708,14 +3708,14 @@ body[data-tab="post"] .lib-refined { display: inline-flex; }
   body[data-tab="create"] .k-split.is-dragging::after { background: var(--amber); }
   body.is-resizing-rows, body.is-resizing-rows * { cursor: row-resize !important; user-select: none !important; }
 
-  /* folded, the takes are one bar under the take, and the take has the third to itself */
-  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr) !important; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; }
-  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded .k-split { display: none; }
-  body[data-tab="create"] .library.is-folded .lib-unfold {
-    writing-mode: horizontal-tb; flex-direction: row; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 10px;
-    width: 100%; height: 40px; padding: 0 16px;
+  /* folded, the takes are a strip at the right edge, its word on its side (Viktor 05.10.2026: «Сворачиваем вправо, текст
+     свёртки поверни на 90%»; a bar under the take sat under the server log), and the take has the third's whole height */
+  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded {
+    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr) 40px !important; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr);
   }
-  body[data-tab="create"] .library.is-folded .lib-unfold-name { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded #view-compose, body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded #view-take { grid-row: 1; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded .library { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] .workspace.lib-folded .k-split { display: none; }
 
   /* the takes in compact cards: the title, then its marks, length and time beside its workspace and its votes */
   body[data-tab="create"] .library .lib-list { gap: 2px; padding: 6px 8px; }
@@ -3763,3 +3763,20 @@ body[data-tab="post"] .lib-refined { display: inline-flex; }
   body[data-tab="create"] #view-take .take-tools .btn.small { padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11.5px; }
   body[data-tab="create"] #view-take .tool-row { gap: 5px; }
 }
+
+/* the player in one row in the Creator, as when the page is scaled up (HERESY 1150; Viktor 05.10.2026: «в такой раскладке
+   на странице Творца плеер делаем минималистичным, как в увеличенном режиме скейла. А в других комнатах оставляем текущие
+   версии плеера»): from 1660 px (below it the scaled-up rule already does it) */
+@media (min-width: 1660px) {
+  body[data-tab="create"] { --playbar-h: 70px; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 8px 18px; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar .pb-row { display: contents; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar .playbar-id { order: 1; flex: 0 1 360px; }
+  /* a long name wraps to two lines here too, never cut (HERESY 1106) */
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar .pb-names strong {
+    white-space: normal; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; line-height: 1.25;
+  }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar #wave { order: 2; flex: 1 1 160px; width: auto; min-width: 120px; height: 40px; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar .pb-ctrl { order: 3; flex: none; }
+  body[data-tab="create"] #playbar .pb-side { order: 4; flex: none; }
+}
